 nets so you will get bitten.||No WiFi in any rooms or we couldn't access as no details were posted anywhere.||Shared toilets and showers.  These were very clean, and with a towel, shampoo and toilet roll provided.  That is a plus, unless they are classing a wet towel as a light stain. I would recommend getting your own to avoid any doubt.||The street view rooms okay, but very noisy. Plenty of shops, food outlets and street vendors.  Buyer beware.  Make sure you are not over charged.||Has a large staircase to go up and down, so if disabled then this place is a definite no no. However they did help me up the stairs with my large heavy suitcase.||Security is 24/7 but don't check who you are. I would recommend showing your key. Not sure how secure rooms are.||Shower Rooms don't lock, and if they do lock, locks sometimes jam and lock you in.||The venue's official site says they have a bar and breakfast facility, no information on these.  They also claim, towel change, internet, common area, daily cleaning.  These don't appear to be truthful statements.\",null,\"Be aware that they charge 200php upon arrival.||Have some charges that they will try and charge.  We slept on the floor to avoid making sheets dirty,\",false,false]]],\"https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g298459-d4323003-r971512850?m\\u003d68573\\u0026staydates\\u003d2026_05_31_2026_06_01\\u0026uguests\\u003d1_2_0\\u0026supdv\\u003ddesktop\\u0026supuc\\u003dPH\\u0026supul\\u003den\",null,null,null,\"\",\"\"]],\"https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g298459-d4323003-r971512850?m\\u003d68573\\u0026staydates\\u003d2026_05_31_2026_06_01\\u0026uguests\\u003d1_2_0\\u0026supdv\\u003ddesktop\\u0026supuc\\u003dPH\\u0026supul\\u003den\",100532569,[[1779092311477060,40274373,389145569],null,null,null,null,[[71]]],\"https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g298459-d4323003-r971512850?m\\u003d68573\\u0026staydates\\u003d2026_05_31_2026_06_01\\u0026uguests\\u003d1_2_0\\u0026supdv\\u003ddesktop\\u0026supuc\\u003d